    <string name="events_attention_acknowledge_expectation">Acknowledge → keep the row, mark ACKNOWLEDGED, then advance to the next queued candidate (or close if none).</string>
    <string name="events_attention_later_expectation">Later → keep the row and move it into the next sequence. The current queue continues first; when it drains, deferred items become eligible.</string>
    <string name="events_attention_suspend_expectation">Suspend → keep the row active but move it behind unsuspended items in the current queue.</string>
    <string name="events_attention_suppress_expectation">Suppress → keep the row, mark SUPPRESSED for this lab session, and remove it from proactive attention until Reset lab.</string>
